lmspace includes the following third-party component. The source is fetched by
scripts/sync-deps.sh at the exact commit recorded in deps.lock and is not
committed to this repository.

================================================================================
NAIF CSPICE Toolkit (N0067 source; NASA/JPL/Caltech)
================================================================================

The CSPICE C sources and headers are from the NAIF SPICE Toolkit. The pinned
packaging mirror is https://github.com/tudat-team/cspice-cmake at commit
e44da83b8a7a420fdddf02d2e3accebd0ab86e5e. The mirror states that it copied the
source directly from https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/naif/; the official origin and
the authoritative use and redistribution rules are:
https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/naif/rules.html

NAIF rules require that unmodified redistribution of the official SPICE Toolkit
from a mirror have prior written clearance from the NAIF manager. This product
is a customer-built SPICE-based tool and includes the Toolkit source modules
as part of that tool, with a new lmspace interface. The source is compiled
without source modifications; only the build wrapper and lmspace interface are
new code. No SPICE kernels are included or required at build time. User-provided
kernels remain subject to the terms of their original distributors.

