Tudat cspice-cmake packaging files
================================================================================

The upstream mirror's packaging CMakeLists.txt and README are under the
Modified BSD terms stated in those files. lmspace does not use that CMake
project; its own small CMake wrapper is MIT-licensed and builds the unchanged
NAIF source files directly.

